ion instead.",1,""],["mrt",4,"z","013",null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_116","a","009","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","Oh right...==W== The commission.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_116","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","Come with me, then. Watch your steps.",0,""],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_116","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.3],["w",0.3],["bgm",""],["se","se_066"],["trn",0,3,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","uniseed_exhibition",0,0.0],["cbg",0,null,null,0.9,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["show","avg1_116","a","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["trn",1,3,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_060"],["cbg",0,null,null,1.0,"Linear",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_116","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.2],["w",0.2],["mrt",2,"z","012",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Um, Ridge...==W== Is it just me,==W== or is there something a little off about this greenhouse...?",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",4,"z","012",null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_116","a",null,"question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","Really? Everything seems totally normal to me...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a","009","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"chijing2","Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","Ah! Boss, don't go over there!",0,""],["w",0.1],["se","se_409"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,"Zhong"],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,50.0,null,"OutSine",0.2,null,null,null],["w",0.2],["mrt",2,"z","007","symbol",null],["tsk","Xiao"],["say","avg3_100","Eh...? Whoa—",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","007",null,"ChanDou"],["say","avg3_100","I-I almost fell in… I can't believe there are traps in a place like this...",1,""],["se","se_251"],["stg",0,null,-50.0,null,"Linear",0.3,null,null,null],["w",0.3],["fx",0,"fx_avg_line_cen_lp",1,0],["bgm","m28"],["mrt",0,"z","012","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Why are there so many traps in the United Harvest greenhouse? Did someone ask you to set them up?",1,""],["mrt",4,"z","012",null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_116","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","No, it's not like that.",0,""],["se","se_147"],["ctl","avg1_116","a","009",null,0.4,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","It's because there are always thieves coming to steal my supplies. Sometimes they even vandalize my test plots.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a","008",null,null,-0.1,1.1,null,null,"OutSine",0.2],["say","avg1_116","So I set up some security measures in the important areas.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a","007","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","And...==W== I might've gone a little overboard with them~",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","... Just a little?",2,""],["mrt",4,"z","020",null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_116","a","003","attention",0.6,null,null,null,"Tiao","InSine",0.2],["say","avg1_116","Let's not worry about that for now...==W== Here we are. This is my test plot.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["stg",0,-60.0,null,1.1,"OutSine",0.2,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_116","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","My commission is about the corn I'm growing here.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a","004","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","Even though I planted only certified high-yield varieties, there are always noticeable differences in yield out in the field.",0,""],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg1_116","a","003",null,null,null,1.15,null,null,"Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","Boss, could you help me figure something out?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","010","sigh",null],["say","avg3_100","Hmm...==W== I'd love to help, but...==W== I don't really know anything about farming...",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",4,"z","010",null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_116","a","006","flower",null,null,null,null,"niunie","Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","But I figure there's nothing that you can't do, Boss! I just know you'll be able to help me with this!",0,""],["w",0.2],["ctl","avg1_116","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.2],["mrt",2,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","She's looking at me so expectantly that I can't bring myself to say anything but yes...",2,""],["mrt",0,"z","014",null,null],["say","avg3_100","All right, let's go over the situation.",1,""],["mrt",0,"z","002","question",null],["say","avg3_100","You mean, even though you picked all high-yield seeds, the corn harvest still turns out different every time?",1,""],["mrt",4,"z","002",null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_116","a","003","star",null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","Yeah, that's right! Boss, you really catch on fast!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","009","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","Ways to increase yield, huh...==W== Thinking back, I'm pretty sure I read something about this in a book inside the Monolith... What was it again...?",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["bgm",""],["mrt",0,"z","025","idea",null],["say","avg3_100","Right, I think it was about a \"pea experiment.\"",1,""],["mrt",4,"z","025",null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_055"],["say","0","Going off what I could vaguely remember, I gave Ridge a quick rundown of the \"pea experiment.\"",0,""],["bg","uniseed_exhibition_dusk",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.5,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["show","avg1_116","a","003",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["bgm","m23"],["ctl","avg1_116","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","Uh-huh, I get it! So basically, you just need to crossbreed the high-yield varieties, right?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","You could re-evaluate how each variety performs in different environments.==W== Make sure the fertilizer matches... If you maximize all that, then I'm sure it would work...!",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_116","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","Boss, you're amazing! Those suggestions sound just like something an expert would say. They really help me a lot!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","002","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Is it really all that? Well, as long as it helps, I'm glad.",1,""],["mrt",4,"z","002",null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_116","a","008",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","I'll try planting a batch of peas just like you suggested, right this minute~",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","002","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Peas? Aren't you growing corn?",1,""],["mrt",4,"z","002",null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_116","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","Yeah. Jumping straight to corn might be a bit risky. Since it's called the \"pea experiment,\" I'll try it with peas first.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","Once I get the hang of this breeding method, I'll use it for other crops too.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a","006","happy",null,null,null,null,"diantou2","Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","Wow~ That means the commission is complete right?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_116","a","008","exclamation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.2],["w",0.7],["se","se_072"],["ctl","avg1_116","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.2],["w",0.2],["ctl","avg1_116","a",null,null,null,null,0.97,0.0,null,"Linear",0.2],["w",1.4],["se","se_072"],["ctl","avg1_116","a",null,null,null,null,1.0,1.0,null,"Linear",0.2],["w",0.2],["ctl","avg1_116","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.2],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg1_116","a","003","flower",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.2],["say","avg1_116","—All right then! You can have all of this—==W==every last bit!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a",null,null,null,-0.2,1.2,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_393"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5,null,null,"Xiao"],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"z","025","exclamation",null],["say","avg3_100","Oh, wow... Once again, there's so much... Anyway, thanks.",1,""],["mrt",0,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","A whole cart full of fruits and veggies... By the looks of it, the New Star Guild shouldn't have to worry about food for a while.",2,""],["mrt",4,"y","020",null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_116","a","006",null,0.5,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_116","If you ever need more, just let me know, don't be shy~",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["mrt",2,"z","013","happy",null],["say","avg3_100","Haha...==W== If I take any more, I won't be able to carry it all back... But thank you, I really appreciate it.",1,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["mrt",4,"z","013",null,null],["w",0.7],["end"]]}